From: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:02:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] mm: page_alloc: disable watermark boosting and optimize watermark scale for low-memory routers

================================================================================
MAXNET High-Performance Kernel Engine & Hardware Architecture Optimization
Engineered & Developed by Mahendra Mali (Max) for MAXNET Router OS
Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
================================================================================

Disable watermark boosting and set scale factor to 50 to prevent premature OOM kills on 512MB RAM.

Signed-off-by: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
---
--- a/mm/page_alloc.c
+++ b/mm/page_alloc.c
@@ -301,8 +301,14 @@
 
 int min_free_kbytes = 1024;
 int user_min_free_kbytes = -1;
-static int watermark_boost_factor __read_mostly = 15000;
-static int watermark_scale_factor = 10;
+/* MAXNET Low-Memory VM Optimization by Mahendra Mali (Max):
+ * Disable aggressive watermark boosting on 512MB networking platforms to
+ * prevent premature OOM killing of network daemons, and scale watermark
+ * to 50 (0.5%) for smoother page reclaim headroom without memory exhaustion.
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
+ */
+static int watermark_boost_factor __read_mostly = 0;
+static int watermark_scale_factor = 50;
 int defrag_mode;
 
 /* movable_zone is the "real" zone pages in ZONE_MOVABLE are taken from */
